          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.12,
            0.882,
            0.159
          ],
          "content": "**6. Describe situations corresponding to the following algebraic expressions:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.174,
            0.329,
            0.192
          ],
          "content": "**(a) 8 × x + 3 × y**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.197,
            0.204,
            0.213
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.215,
            0.882,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": "A shopkeeper sells a pen for ₹x and a notebook for ₹y. Abha buys 8 pens and 3 notebooks. What will be the total cost of her purchase?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.282,
            0.336,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": "**(b) 15 × j – 2 × k**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.306,
            0.204,
            0.322
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.324,
            0.883,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": "A factory makes 15 chairs every day. If the factory works for j days, it will make 15 × j chairs. But 2 chairs break daily for k days. How many good chairs remain after j days and k days breakages?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.391,
            0.407,
            0.41
          ],
          "content": "Try for more situations"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.427,
            0.884,
            0.485
          ],
          "content": "**7. In a calendar month, if any 2 × 3 grid full of dates is chosen as shown in the picture, write expressions for the dates in the blank cells if the bottom middle cell has date ‘w’.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
